&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Market Intelligence Representative (MIR)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;to nurture relationships with inbound prospects from our free product, and turn them into qualified leads for our sales pipeline. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role will report to our Team Manager of MIR. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our MIRs are the future Sales leaders of Similarweb and want a thriving career in either the New Business or Account Management space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why is this role so important at Similarweb?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
