&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The relationships you build, and the meetings you are able to create for the sales organization, will have a direct impact on our sales pipeline. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is your chance to launch your hi-tech career in a supportive environment, and provide real value to companies all around the world, from many different industries and verticals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what will you be doing all day?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
