&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Corporate Controller &lt;/strong&gt;to manage our HQ parent company and subsidiaries’ accounting and financial aspects. This role will report to the company’s Director of Finance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
