&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Data Engineer in the Data Collection Ingest team to contribute to the design and coding of Similarweb’s data ingestion services &amp;amp; pipelines. This role involves working as part of a team that handles millions of requests per minute across multiple servers, and is responsible for a wide-range of data pipelines, processing billions of events each day.&lt;/p&gt;
