&lt;li&gt;Perform code reviews, evaluate implementations, and provide feedback about potential improvements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve your skills, learn from and mentor top-notch engineers and enrich other team members.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
