&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Data Scientist &lt;/strong&gt;to join our R&amp;amp;D department!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why is this role so important at Similarweb?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
