&lt;p&gt;In addition, this position is eligible to participate in the company’s sales incentive plan, with a maximum target OTE of up to &lt;em&gt;$240,000&lt;/em&gt;, depending upon the final terms of employment and achievement of established targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
