&lt;p&gt;Similarweb is seeking a&lt;strong&gt; Payments Operations Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to support and optimize our no-touch/self-serve billing stream. In this role, you will ensure smooth customer sign-up, checkout, payment processing, and fraud prevention, while also contributing to cross-company initiatives that shape our billing infrastructure and operational scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with Product, R&amp;amp;D, IS, Finance, and RevOps to support daily operations, troubleshoot issues, improve processes, and drive projects that enhance efficiency and accuracy across our Quote-to-Cash ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
