&lt;li&gt;Monitor and support fraud detection workflows to protect revenue and customer experience, handle chargebacks and disputes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot billing system issues and perform hands-on configurations and QA across platforms (e.g., Zuora, NetSuite, Salesforce).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process improvement opportunities and lead small-to-medium operational projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support cross-company initiatives, including M&amp;amp;A integrations, infrastructure upgrades, and new product/billing flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
