&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in Payments or business operations (SaaS experience a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, attention to detail, and a problem-solving mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ERP/billing systems (NetSuite, Salesforce, Zuora preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with different payment processing systems, including setting up and maintaining fraud prevention mechanisms, improving success rates etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with managing multiple gateways serving different company subsidiaries, currencies and taxation.&lt;/li&gt;
