&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Product Analyst&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team and act as a central pillar between our data, our product, and our business strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn’t a role for someone who just wants to answer tickets. You will be embedded with Product Managers and Growth leaders to not only provide data but to help shape the roadmap and influence how we build, launch, and monetize our products. We are looking for an analyst with a &quot;business partner&quot; mindset, someone who can look at a dataset and see the commercial opportunity or the user friction point before others do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Work alongside PMs and leadership to define success metrics for new features and long-term growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Funnel Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and measure KPIs across the entire user journey, from initial activation to complex monetization and retention loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep-dives to uncover hidden bottlenecks. You won&#39;t just report on what happened; you&#39;ll recommend what we should do next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Narrative Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate complex technical data into clear, &quot;bottom-line first&quot; narratives that drive action across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the analytical bridge, supporting multiple product domains and ensuring a consistent, data-driven approach to every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; At least &lt;strong&gt;2 years of experience&lt;/strong&gt; as an analyst within a SaaS environment. You understand the core levers of a subscription business (ARR, Churn, PLG etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Versatility:&lt;/strong&gt; High proficiency in SQL and experience with BI tools (Looker, Tableau, etc.). You are comfortable picking up new tools and datasets quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Intuition:&lt;/strong&gt; You have a natural ability to connect user behavior to business outcomes. You understand that data is only valuable if it leads to a decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a self-starter who takes extreme ownership. You don&#39;t wait for the &quot;perfect&quot; brief; you dig in and find the answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You can present technical findings to non-technical stakeholders in a way that is clear, persuasive, and insightful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Degree:&lt;/strong&gt; B.Sc. in Industrial Engineering, Economics, Statistics, or a related quantitative field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love Being a Similarwebber&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Your work will influence both product and business strategy across our global customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; We foster a culture of open dialogue where big ideas are encouraged. This role offers real room to grow in scope and influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll work with the world’s most powerful digital intelligence platform and actually love it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re inclusive, innovative, and supportive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We will handle your application and information related to your application in accordance with the Applicant Privacy Policy available &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.similarweb.com/corp/legal/applicant-privacy-policies/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Similarweb is the leading digital intelligence platform used by over 3500 global customers. Our wide range of solutions power the digital strategies of companies like Google, eBay, and Adidas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We help our customers succeed in today&#39;s digital world by giving them access to data-driven insights, competitive benchmarks, strategic analysis, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2021, we went public on the New York Stock Exchange, and we haven&#39;t stopped growing since!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Gen AI Intelligence team&lt;/strong&gt;, owning the &lt;strong&gt;end-to-end data platform&lt;/strong&gt; that powers our next-generation products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity: Why This Role, Why Now&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The marketing world is undergoing its biggest shift in a decade.&lt;/strong&gt; Discovery is no longer just &quot;search&quot;—it&#39;s increasingly mediated by AI. Users are asking questions in ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews, and the traditional &quot;search → click → website&quot; funnel is fragmenting. This shift has created a new discipline: &lt;strong&gt;Generative Engine Optimization (GEO)&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;AI Engine Optimization (AEO)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Similarweb is uniquely positioned to lead this space. We have &lt;strong&gt;proprietary data&lt;/strong&gt; that reveals not just what AI shows users, but &lt;strong&gt;what users actually do next&lt;/strong&gt;—which channels they visit, where demand flows, and how brands win (or leak) visibility. Our mission is to help marketers understand their visibility in AI platforms, connect that visibility to downstream business outcomes, and take action to improve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact of This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Product Manager for our GenAI team*, you will own the &lt;/strong&gt;data backbone&lt;strong&gt; of Gen AI Intelligence. You&#39;ll need to be sharp on &lt;/strong&gt;how to combine, utilize, and analyze diverse data sources** to answer the questions our customers need answered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work at the intersection of our &lt;strong&gt;Data Science team&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering team&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Platform team&lt;/strong&gt;—turning raw data assets into user-facing products. But building the right products requires understanding the domain: you&#39;ll dig into SEO/GEO workflows, spend time with customers and design partners, and learn how marketing teams actually operate. The goal is to let user context drive your data decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your core mandate:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a product area end-to-end within Gen AI Intelligence—from the underlying data and pipelines, through the user-facing experiences, to how customers extract value via APIs and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define what data we need, how we structure it, and how we expose it to users and downstream systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply understand user workflows and jobs-to-be-done to identify the highest-leverage data solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Data Science to translate models and extractions into usable, reliable data pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data quality, coverage, and governance across our Gen AI data estate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive product development end-to-end: from discovery through definition, prototyping, design, development, and deployment—with continuous iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across a multi-disciplinary team: data scientists, data engineers, full-stack developers, UX designers, product marketers, and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do day-to-day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Obsess over user context&lt;/strong&gt;: Understand how SEO practitioners, content marketers, and marketing leaders actually work—what questions they&#39;re trying to answer, what data would unlock value, and where current solutions fall short&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define data products end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;: From discovery through definition, schema design, pipeline development, and delivery—ensuring consistent quality and velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect data to user outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with product teams that consume your data (reporting UX, recommendations, APIs) to ensure the data products actually solve user problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner deeply with Data Science and Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: Translate DS models into production-ready data products; define requirements for data engineering pipelines; prioritize platform investments;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the core metrics, datasets, reports, and insights &lt;/strong&gt;that will be made available to our users through our SaaS platform, APIs and MCPs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own data quality and coverage&lt;/strong&gt;: Define metrics for data completeness, accuracy, and freshness; build feedback loops to continuously improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make tradeoffs with evidence&lt;/strong&gt;: Use quantitative and qualitative analysis and user research to prioritize ruthlessly—not everything can be built, so you need to know what matters most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is the perfect job for someone who has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years as a Product Manager on data-centric products&lt;/strong&gt; (data platforms, analytics products, ML-powered features, or similar)—you&#39;ve shipped data products that users depend on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience working in a data company or on data products&lt;/strong&gt; where the core value proposition was derived from data (not just &quot;we use data&quot;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong analytical and data skills&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;re comfortable querying data, analyzing patterns, and making data-informed decisions. You can hold your own in conversations about data modeling, schemas, and pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep user empathy and research skills&lt;/strong&gt;: You don&#39;t just build what stakeholders ask for—you dig into user workflows and jobs-to-be-done to find the real problem worth solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience working with Data Science and Data Engineering teams&lt;/strong&gt;: You know how to translate between DS/ML outputs and production systems, and you understand the tradeoffs involved&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communication skills&lt;/strong&gt;: You can write a clear PRD, present to leadership, and align cross-functional teams around a shared vision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong pluses:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQL proficiency&lt;/strong&gt;: You can write queries to explore data, validate hypotheses, and QA outputs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Python or other scripting ability&lt;/strong&gt;: You can prototype analyses, automate checks, or dig into data yourself when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience in digital marketing, SEO, or adjacent domains&lt;/strong&gt;: Understanding of how marketers think about search, content, and visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with B2B SaaS and enterprise customers&lt;/strong&gt;: You understand long sales cycles, packaging, and the needs of mid-market/enterprise buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curiosity over credentials&lt;/strong&gt;: You want to understand how things work, not just ship features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bias for action&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;d rather test a hypothesis with an imperfect solution than wait for perfect information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with ambiguity&lt;/strong&gt;: GEO/AEO is a new space—you&#39;ll help define what &quot;good&quot; looks like, not just execute a playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you&#39;ll love being a Similarwebber&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll work on a genuinely new problem space&lt;/strong&gt;: GEO and AI visibility is an emerging category. You won&#39;t be iterating on a mature product—you&#39;ll be defining what the product should even be.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll have access to unique data assets&lt;/strong&gt;: Similarweb&#39;s real-user behavioral data is genuinely differentiated. You&#39;ll get to figure out how to turn that into user value—a rare opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll actually love the product you work with&lt;/strong&gt;: When we asked our employees why they chose to come work at Similarweb, 99% of them said &quot;the product.&quot; Imagine how exciting your job is when you get to work with the most powerful digital intelligence platform in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll find a home for your big ideas&lt;/strong&gt;: We encourage an open dialogue and empower employees to bring their ideas to the table. You&#39;ll find the resources you need to take initiative and create meaningful change within the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We offer competitive perks &amp;amp; benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; We take your well-being seriously, and offer competitive compensation packages to all employees. We also put a strong emphasis on community, with regular team outings and happy hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can grow your career in any direction you choose:&lt;/strong&gt; Whether it&#39;s Career Week, personalized coaching, or our ongoing learning solutions, you&#39;ll find all the tools and opportunities you need to develop your career right here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity isn&#39;t just a buzzword:&lt;/strong&gt; We strive to create a workplace that is reflective of the communities we serve, where everyone is empowered to bring their full, authentic selves to work. We are committed to inclusivity across race, gender, ethnicity, culture, sexual orientation, age, religion, spirituality, identity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will handle your application and information related to your application in accordance with the Applicant Privacy Policy available here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We will handle your application and information related to your application in accordance with the Applicant Privacy Policy available &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.similarweb.com/corp/legal/applicant-privacy-policies/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At Similarweb, we are revolutionizing the way businesses interact with the digital world by revealing to them everything that happens online. Our unique data and solutions empower over 6,000 customers globally, including industry giants like Google, eBay, and Adidas, to make game-changing decisions that drive their digital strategies. In 2021, we went public on the New York Stock Exchange, and we continue to reach new heights. Work alongside Similarwebbers from around the globe who are bright, curious, practical, and genuinely good people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Market Intelligence Representative (MIR)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;to nurture relationships with inbound prospects from our free product, and turn them into qualified leads for our sales pipeline. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This role will report to our Team Manager of MIR. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our MIRs are the future Sales leaders of Similarweb and want a thriving career in either the New Business or Account Management space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why is this role so important at Similarweb?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We receive thousands of inbound leads through our free product, and many of them don’t yet know the value our marketing intelligence product can bring to their company. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As an MIR, you will be the first touchpoint for these new prospects, proving to them the value of Similarweb by sharing relevant insights from our data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The relationships you build, and the meetings you are able to create for the sales organization, will have a direct impact on our sales pipeline. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This is your chance to launch your hi-tech career in a supportive environment, and provide real value to companies all around the world, from many different industries and verticals.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what will you be doing all day?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Your role as part of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demand Generation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;means your daily responsibilities may include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Taking inbound calls, chats and responding to contact forms to qualify relevant prospects that could benefit from Similarweb’s many digital intelligence solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Finding relevant insights and data to share with prospects that showcase the true value that Similarweb would bring to their digital strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Sharing these insights either verbally, or through email&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Filling the sales pipeline, by creating a set number of meetings between prospects and sales managers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Partnering with our marketing department to brainstorm and execute campaigns that show the value of our insights to our registered user base&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is the perfect job for someone who is:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SMART&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Dynamic thinker:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; continuously invests in adopting or adapting to think and respond to challenges critically and creatively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Creative:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Finding creative solutions to resolve complex issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Communicator: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;excellent both verbally and written.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tech savvy: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Embrace advanced technology and incorporate it into your daily workflow.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DRIVEN TO SUCCEED&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Goal driven:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Motivated to achieve and exceed what is asked of them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Tenacious: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Passion and grit are your currency and you know how to stay focused.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Resilient:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Can handle objections and not take them personally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMBLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Adaptable:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Able to adjust to changes quickly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Collaborative: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Team player who knows how to work with others to achieve your goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Coachable: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Listening to feedback and apply accordingly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Emotionally Intelligent: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ability to manage both your own emotions and understand the emotions of people around you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;**At Similarweb, collaborating with our colleagues in-office creates a more connected, unified culture. Our best work is a product of our face-to-face collaboration, with the ability to work partially from home.**&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The base salary for this position in the Burlington, Massachusetts area is $56,000 + benefits, including: medical, dental, and vision insurance, 401K plan, potential equity, employee stock purchase plan, and paid sick and parental leave.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;In addition, this position is eligible to participate in the company’s sales incentive plan, with a maximum target OTE of up to $70,000, depending upon the final terms of employment and achievement of established targets.&lt;br&gt;Individual compensation is based upon a number of factors, including qualifications and relevant experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The base salary range above is for the Burlington, Massachusetts area, and could vary for candidates in other locations.&lt;/p&gt;
