&lt;li&gt;Track record of hitting numbers in a fast paced environment, has had success self-sourcing meetings in a startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in selling SaaS solutions in Data or Analytics industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Salesforce and MEDDPICC sales process would be an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building value-based sales strategy and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loves working with data and has strong business acumen across various industries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
