&lt;p&gt;As a data scientist in Similarweb, you will work on the very core of the company. Part of your role will be to turn raw data into usable metrics and develop new models and statistical algorithms to support out-of-the box requests from customers who want custom digital insights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, what will you be doing all day?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
