&lt;li&gt;Has 5+ years of experience with statistical and machine learning tools - Python, R, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicative and verbal abilities to lead and guide customers through the logic of custom-built models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has previous experience developing machine learning/ image processing/NLP or similar algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience utilizing probability theory and statistics&lt;/li&gt;
