&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why is this role so important at Similarweb?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital advertising is at the core of every growth strategy, and understanding where competitors invest their budgets is critical for marketers, agencies, and publishers. &lt;strong&gt;Ad Intelligence is one of Similarweb’s most strategic solutions,&lt;/strong&gt; helping customers optimize their media spend, uncover new opportunities, and stay ahead of the competition.&lt;br&gt;With Similarweb’s unique datasets, advanced data modeling, and trusted position in the market, we are redefining how advertisers benchmark their search, social, and display advertising performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager for Ad Intelligence, you will &lt;strong&gt;own and expand Similarweb’s cross-channel advertising analytics.&lt;/strong&gt; You will ensure our customers have the most accurate, granular, and actionable ad spend, creative, and performance insights in the industry.&amp;nbsp;Whether it’s by expanding ads data coverage, improving spend and impression estimation, or designing intuitive reports and workflows to surface competitive insights, you will play a key role in making Similarweb indispensable for ad professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
