&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and own the product roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; – prioritize initiatives based on customer value, business impact, and data feasibility.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
