&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why is this role so important?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Sales Intelligence (SI) team&lt;/strong&gt;. While our Sales Ops-focused teams build the &quot;backbone&quot; of sales strategy (B2B-heavy data and admin flows), &lt;strong&gt;this role is dedicated to the Sales Person.&lt;/strong&gt; Your mission is to build the &quot;B2C-style&quot; front-end experience for individual sales professionals. You will create tools that aren&#39;t just powerful, but are a joy to use—making digital intelligence feel like a superpower in the hands of every salesperson. You will lead the strategy for how a seller finds, researches, and closes deals daily.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day to day as a Product Manager means...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;User-Centric Research:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep-dive interviews and observations with Sales Reps, Account Executives, and SDRs to understand their daily &quot;hustle&quot; and friction points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;B2C Mindset in a B2B World:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and define features that feel like consumer-grade apps—fast, intuitive, and immediately actionable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Vision &amp;amp; Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and adjust the vision for &quot;Sales Empowerment&quot; tools, ensuring they align with our broader Sales Intelligence goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with big data engineers and data scientists to turn complex signals into simple &quot;buying cues,&quot; while working with designers to ensure a seamless UI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid Iteration:&lt;/strong&gt; Roll out features responsibly through beta programs, monitoring KPIs like &quot;Daily Active Usage&quot; and &quot;Time-to-Value&quot; for the individual seller.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI for Sales:&lt;/strong&gt; Define how AI can automate the &quot;boring stuff&quot; for sellers—from personalized outreach generation to automated prospect discovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I bring to the team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
