&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a&lt;strong&gt; Social Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; Manager (B2C) &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;to scale the audience and revenue of multiple cross-platform products. This role will report to Team Lead Marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
