&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills: Exceptional written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social Media Expertise: Proficiency across major platforms, including Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, Reddit, and Twitter, along with a solid understanding of platform rules and measurement tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content Creation Skills: Ability to create compelling static and video assets using tools such as Canva, Figma, and Gen AI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native video editing: Ability to create social media content natively on platforms such as TikTok, Instagram, CapCut, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trend Awareness: Strong knowledge of current social media trends, best practices, and a basic understanding of B2C SAAS tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration Skills: Ability to work cross-functionally with creative, marketing, and analytics teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical Thinking: Data-driven mindset with experience in analytics and reporting to measure and improve performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
