&lt;li&gt;Travel regularly across EMEA to meet your clients or attend events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upskill current team around ENT multi-product selling, Strategic Planning, Whitespacing, Outreach, Negotiation, Deal Strategy, Objection Handling, Executive Alignment&lt;/li&gt;
