&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills with experience leading 6-figure &lt;strong&gt;complex enterprise deals&lt;/strong&gt;, including engagement with Procurement, Legal, and senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience managing or overseeing a &lt;strong&gt;book of global, multi-country enterprise accounts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success selling &lt;strong&gt;multi-product, value-based solutions&lt;/strong&gt; into existing customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience building and scaling &lt;strong&gt;pipeline generation motions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of digital marketing and online growth levers, including channels such as SEO, Paid Search, Display, Affiliate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling or working with digital intelligence, analytics, or marketing technology platforms&lt;/li&gt;
